{"id":"sokrovishche","lemma":"сокровище","pos":"noun","rank":2400,"glosses":["treasure (collection of valuable things)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"сокровища","plural":"сокровища"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы ищем сокровище.","en":"We're looking for the treasure.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to look for, to seek","l":"искать"},null]},{"text":"Как Том смог найти сокровища?","en":"How was Tom able to find the treasure?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to be able, to manage","l":"смочь"},{"g":"to find"},null]},{"text":"Говорят, там спрятаны сокровища.","en":"It's rumored there are treasures hidden there.","words":[{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"there"},null,null]},{"text":"Почему бы нам не закопать сокровище тут?","en":"Why don't we bury the treasure here?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to bury, to dig"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Сокровище было закопано на острове.","en":"The treasure was buried on an island.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null]}]}